<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Nov trade deficit rises to $192.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Nov trade deficit rises to $192.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>SLOVENIA TRADE (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				    Nov     Oct	   Nov95</p>
<p> Trade balance		-192.2    -81.7	-123.6</p>
<p> Exports			 633.5    741.1	 729.1</p>
<p> Imports			 825.7    822.8	 852.7</p>
<p>NOTE - all figures are rounded.</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
